Package: codebookr
Title: Researcher-Approved Codebook-Assisted Data Preprocessing
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: person("CodebookR", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.org")
Description: Local R Shiny application that reads social science data and
    PDF/Excel codebooks, proposes conservative preprocessing rules, and
    exports an auditable, standalone R script. No AI-written code is executed.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
